--   An `E₁`-approximation of `2^p S'` is an `FPApprox` of any line map fitted to `Sapprox` (`fp_of_sexact`)
-- statement:
--   An `E₁`-approximation of `2^p S'` is an `FPApprox` of any line map fitted to `Sapprox`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6AMath3`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6A.fp_of_sexact (p s t α : ℕ) [NeZero s] [NeZero t] (hα : 2 ≤ α) (hαp : α ^ 2 ≤ p)
--       (Aa : (ℕ → ℤ × ℤ) → (ℕ → ℤ × ℤ)) (E₁ : ℝ)
--       (hAa : ∀ U, InDisc p U → ∀ k,
--         ‖gC (Aa U k) - 2 ^ p * Sexact s t α (fun i => gC (U i) / 2 ^ p) k‖ ≤ E₁)
--       (L : (ZMod s → ℂ) →L[ℂ] (ZMod t → ℂ))
--       (hL : ∀ U, InDisc p U → ∀ k : ZMod t,
--         ‖gC (Sapprox p s t α U k.val) - 2 ^ p * L (fun j => gC (U j.val) / 2 ^ p) k‖
--           ≤ 6 * sWidth p α + 4)
--       (hE : 0.55 * 2 ^ p + E₁ ≤ 2 ^ p) :
--       FPApprox p Aa (NLogN.KFM.liftL L) (E₁ + 12 * sWidth p α + 8)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** A lines (PR #5 block chirp), part 3: per-axis `FPApprox`
--
--   * `Sexact_resS`: `S'(u)_k = ½ · resS(u)_k`.
--   * `Sexact_norm`: `‖S'(u)_k‖ ≤ 0.55 · sup ‖u‖` (from `resS_norm_le_tight`, `α ≥ 2`).
--   * `fp_of_sexact`: any fixed-point map `Aa` within `E₁` of `2^p S'` is an `FPApprox` of the lifted
--     line map `liftL L`, for every `L` fitted to `Sapprox` within `6m+4` (the `FitSpec6` clause),
--     with error `E₁ + 12m + 8`, provided `0.55·2^p + E₁ ≤ 2^p`.
--   * `chirpA_fp`: the instance `Aa = chirpA`.
--
